{"meta":{"id":"none-handling","category":"it/syntax/python/types","title":"None 처리 · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"is None, 조건식 · or 기본값, dict.get · getattr, X | None","tags":["python","f-null"],"color":"yellow","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-yellow","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-yellow-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-yellow-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 border border-yellow-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">None 처리 · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-yellow-50/70 border border-yellow-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-yellow-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> is None, 조건식 · or 기본값, dict.get · getattr, X | None</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">None 처리</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">user = None\r\n\r\nif user is None:          # None 비교는 == 대신 is\r\n    ...\r\n\r\nname = user.name if user else &quot;이름 없음&quot;     # ?. + ?? 대신 조건식\r\nname = (user and user.name) or &quot;이름 없음&quot;   # or 는 0, &quot;&quot; 도 기본값으로 바꿈 (|| 와 같음)</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">dict · 객체에서 안전하게 꺼내기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">data.get(&quot;user&quot;, {}).get(&quot;name&quot;, &quot;이름 없음&quot;)   # dict — 없으면 기본값\r\ngetattr(obj, &quot;name&quot;, None)                     # 속성 — 없으면 None\r\n\r\ndef find(id: int) -&gt; User | None: ...          # Optional[User] 와 같음</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Python 에는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>?.</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>??</code> 연산자가 없다</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › null 처리, Java › Optional</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/types/none-handling","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/python/types"}],"hasImage":false}